runs/2026-06-17-s5-h7-perperiod-h3c/outputs/h7-idata-*.nc

# Decision-38 recovery re-validation (2026-06-06): per-replicate synthetic data
# + posterior fits regenerate deterministically from base_seed + cell_index +
# replicate; the 450-cell bulk lives on sapphire, like the 2026-05-26 grid.
# Tracked research record: grid-state-final.json, STAGE1-TRIAGE-REPORT.md, the eventual
# tables/grid-summary.parquet, and the 8 already-committed Stage-1 triage
# cell-summaries (the gate record — git keeps already-tracked files). Operational
# orchestrator/full-grid logs and the 442 production cell-summaries are not.
runs/2026-06-06-convention-basis-redesign/revalidation/*/data/synthetic-cells/*/
runs/2026-06-06-convention-basis-redesign/revalidation/*/outputs/cell-fits/*/
runs/2026-06-06-convention-basis-redesign/revalidation/*/outputs/cell-logs/
runs/2026-06-06-convention-basis-redesign/revalidation/*/outputs/cell-summaries/*
runs/2026-06-06-convention-basis-redesign/revalidation/full-grid.log
runs/2026-06-06-convention-basis-redesign/revalidation/STATUS-*.txt

